Hello! I'm Luis and for better or for worse (probably worse) I have recently come into a lot of free time, so I figured, what better way to spend some of this time documenting some of my various hobbies, endeavours and the wacky things that seem to happen to me regularly.

So, what does this entail? Well, I am a bit of a nerd and currently work in transport planning (although I consider this as "freedom planning" thanks to Jarrett Walker). I have dabbled (unsuccessfully) in bass guitar and the kalimba, with the keyboard being my most recent musical venture. Alongside this, I regularly play football, I am starting to plan my first interrail journey and I have started drinking oat milk.
